hat Termux is installed on your Android device. If not, download and install it from the Google Play Store.\n\n2. **Update the Package List**: Before installing any software, it's a good idea to update the package list to make sure you are installing the latest version of the packages.\n   ```sh\n   sudo apt update\n   ```\n\n3. **Upgrade the APT Package Manager**: This ensures that APT is up to date.\n   ```sh\n   sudo apt upgrade -y\n   ```\n\n4. **Install Required Dependencies**:\n   ```sh\n   sudo apt install -y build-essential\n   ```\n\n5. **Install Python**:\n   - Install the latest version of Python:\n     ```sh\n     sudo apt install -y python3 python3-pip\n     ```\n\n6. **Verify the Installation**:\n   ```sh\n   python3 --version\n   ```\n\n   This command will show the version of Python installed on your system to confirm that Python is properly installed and can be accessed from the terminal.\n\n7. **Install Additional Python Packages (Optional)**:\n   If you need to install additional Python packages, you can use `pip`:\n   ```sh\n   pip3 install <package_name>\n   ```\n\nHere is a summary of the commands you need to run:\n```sh\n# Update the package list\nsudo apt update\n\n# Upgrade APT\nsudo apt upgrade -y\n\n# Install build-essential\nsudo apt install -y build-essential\n\n# Install Python and pip\nsudo apt install -y python3 python3-pip\n\n# Verify the installation\npython3 --version\n```\n\nIf at any point you wish to switch to a new interaction, you can type `_SWITCHCONVERSATION_`."}, {"key": [487, 1, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -0.0001411731330608426, "log_surv_s": -0.0010337740436483338, "gen_len": 445, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [487, 1, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -2.2005573397545125e-06, "log_surv_s": -1.2876680840722618e-05, "gen_len": 344, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [497, 1, "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -3.926467047369635e-09, "log_surv_s": -7.203476146573175e-09, "gen_len": 146, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [497, 1, "f